stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> forming: first item, no target selected it yet
  forming --> forming: item attached, revision + 1
  forming --> published: a target selected and delivered it
  forming --> dropped: quiet window elapsed, no target ever selected it
  forming --> merged: found to be the same event as another unpublished story
  published --> published: item attached, revision + 1
  published --> dormant: quiet window elapsed
  dropped --> [*]
  merged --> [*]
  dormant --> published: item attached inside the memory window
  dormant --> closed: memory window elapsed
  forming --> closed: event date passed (kind = event)
  published --> closed: event date passed (kind = event)
  closed --> [*]
